  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "^red;The following details infractions allegedly committed against other members of the outpost by one Myulthor 'Kevin' Sanchatak^white; : "
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "^red; 次の詳細は、Myultor 'ケヴィン' Sanchatak ^white;によって前置詞の他のメンバーに対してコミットされたと伝えられる侵害です。 "
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Jun 1 - This individual broke into my private office, stole all of my grapes, and rather than eat them constructed an elaborate 'art piece' of me. Peeing on a beehive. He then filled the room with bees, so that when I opened the door I got swarmed and stung 755 times."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Jun 1 ――この人は私室に押し入り、ブドウを全部盗み、それを食べるのではなく、精巧な「芸術品」を作ってくれました。 蜂の巣を覗く。 それから部屋をミツバチで満たし、ドアを開けると群がって刺された。 755 時間だ"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/10",
      "value": "Jun 25 - Despite his clear genius, when asked on where he completed his education Kevin merely slapped me on the ass and told me to be a good servant and get him a coffee. He then proceeded to follow me around for the rest of the day making 'wide-load' truck-beeping sounds every time I moved."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/10",
      "value": "Jun 25 - 彼の明確な天才にもかかわらず、ケビンはどこで彼の教育を完了したかを尋ねられたとき、単に私にお尻を叩き、私に良い召使いであることを言い、彼にコーヒーを渡すように言った。 それから彼は、私が移動するたびに「ワイドロード」トラックビーピングの音を鳴らす一日の残りの間、私を追いかけました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/100",
